  "releaseNotes": "Validation & Integrity:\n      - Implemented \"Hybrid Validation\" pattern: unified dual-layer checks for both Debug (Fail-fast via Assert) and Release (Safety via Exceptions).\n      - Refactored LuciferGuard to centralize range and null-pointer logic, eliminating redundant checks and ensuring consistent behavior across the framework.\n      - Synchronized core classes (Buffer, PooledObject, etc.) to use the updated validation pipeline.\n      - Enhanced memory safety in Buffer operations (Resize, Shift, Unshift) with explicit boundary and overflow protection.",
